  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Support to ECOWAS in Peace, Security and Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support ECOWAS in its conflict prevention mandate, in the following areas of conflict prevention, early warning and early response as well as entrench safe and secure post-conflict environments while strengthening electoral processes and democratic transitions; and protecting human rights and democratic accountability in ECOWAS Member States.</narrative>
  </description>
